---
import { Backlight } from "$lib/components/magic/backlight";
---

<section class="grid place-items-center lg:mt-0 mt-10" id="join">
  <div class="relative">
    <h1 class="font-mono text-4xl text-center mb-6">
      Want to <Backlight class="text-emerald-400 inline-block">join?</Backlight>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-6 text-center text-xs">
      We're still accepting new members!!!
    </p>
    <p class="lg:mx-0 lg:w-[70ch] mx-4">
      I have removed the QR code as I don't regularly check the form anymore. If
      you'd like to join, message <span class="text-emerald-400"
        >fanhongmeng.zhai@students.nido.cl</span
      > on GChat! <i
        >Keep in mind you will need to catch up to the content we're doing right
        now... unless you already know coding (let's talk about it!)</i
      >
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
